              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خدمات (khadamât) — \"services\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خدمات (khadamât) این هتل خیلی خوب است. Khadamât-e in hotel kheyli khub ast. This hotel's services are very good."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An Arabic plural of khedmat 'service'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khadamât is the Arabic plural of khedmat 'service', which EtymDB takes from Arabic ḫidma 'service'. EtymDB does not list the plural."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
